# Issues Involved in Developing Integrated Optical Jukebox Storage Systems for Customized Applications.

**Authors:** Augsburger, Wayne, McNary, Larry

## Abstract
Suggests a process for evaluating and planning integrated optical jukebox storage systems. Considerations regarding architecture and system performance are summarized, and a modeling program for tailoring system response to specific applications is presented. Five robotics algorithms are examined to illustrate different hardware configurations. Interface options, maximizing performance, and software design issues are also discussed. (MES)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ446152

